Hi there,

I'm thinking of renting out the Castellan Imperial for a corporate event - it=
's been a while since I've gotten to drive something like that, reminds me of=
 the time I rented a similar car for my sister's wedding. We would pick it up=
 on Sun 25 Apr 2027 at 08:30 and bring it back on Tue 27 Apr 2027 at 10 am. I=
 just wanted to clarify that the pick-up date is indeed Sun 9 May 2027, not t=
he initial drop-off date. Also, could you bring it to the Old Customs House, =
Port Linden and collect it from there afterwards? I've included a copy of my =
driving licence as requested.

Best wishes,
Ada Dunsmere

